    <guid isPermaLink="false">694568459f70e5d6b33ead16</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 19:38:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Nancy</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kiddy（在这次播客中还被称呼为K老师）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>猴哥（在这次播客中还被称呼为Lu老师)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>猴哥、Kiddy和Nancy在10月和11月分别度过了一段自己的旅行，大家分别去了意大利、法国和夏威夷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们这次从长途飞行的体验开始聊起，探讨了欧洲与美国在文化、生活习惯、公共设施，以及支付方式上的巨大差异，还研讨了旅行的意义及未来的出游计划，欢迎来收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你有没有出国旅行的过往或者计划？你有什么独特的体验呢？也可以和猴哥一起分享。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>长途飞行体验与机票选择 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>文化观察：小偷、涂鸦与公共行为 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>生活日常：饮水、厕所与环保习惯 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2507">41:47</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>支付与交通：信用卡、现金与铁路体验 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4802">1:20:02</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>语言、制服与社交习惯 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6314">1:45:14</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>旅行意义与未来计划 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8674">2:24:34</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【延展信息】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fux9bZJNPrTw6rPXCRRYGqek_kCx.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>画在意大利火车上的涂鸦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvF1yE3l3LWGbNdSPMSuI2mUz8-f.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>意大利特有的清洁设备——bidet（图中左下角的设施）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP2S55KjlrtSnmDzwdML1sbeG-P.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>威尼斯书店门口的防小偷提示</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvtXNqNWuO7tiH3TG29N5cbG7k92.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>罗马地铁车站</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【与猴哥沟通】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：me@pickten.cn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网站：</span><a href="https://pickten.cn/podcast/" data-url="https://pickten.cn/podcast/"><span>pickten.cn</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：猴哥快溜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【创作素材】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>背景音乐《A Country Romance》，作者Ahjay Stelino，由mixkit提供</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
