  <item>
    <title>E5 | 经济上上下下，生活缝缝补补 | 猴哥✓Nancy✓Kiddy</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6898b69c20a2906a4dd9530e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6898b69c20a2906a4dd9530e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Nancy</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kiddy（在这次播客中还被称呼为K老师）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>猴哥（在这次播客中还被称呼为Lu老师)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期播客，我们从经济下行、消费降级，聊到了健身、玄学，后面还提到了车祸的经历，以及在鬼屋里面的见识。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期聊的像是一个“生活大杂烩”，但是这次主题的核心只有一个——在充满不确定性的年代里，我们如何调整心态、找到自己的节奏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是如何面对生活的不确定性的？也可以和我们一起交流！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>经济下行与消费降级 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span><br><span>减少非必要开支、二手商品购买、记账习惯 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a></span><br><span>讨论国内外生活成本差异 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a></span><br><span>反思“全职儿女”现象和代际经济压力 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>生活方式与心理暗示</span><br><span>“五行穿衣法则”的实践与心理安慰作用 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a></span><br><span>玄学与正向心理暗示 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">38:24</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>健身、健康与身体反馈 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a> </span><br><span>做一个“老鼠人” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">52:11</a></span><br><span>身体疼痛的积极意义 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4034">1:07:14</a></span><br><span>冷浴（冰浴）、断食 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4238">1:10:38</a> 以及 正念和呼吸 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4677">1:17:57</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>车祸经历与社会观察 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5075">1:24:35</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>鬼屋体验与“脸皮厚”哲学 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6865">1:54:25</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【延展信息】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>图书《当下的力量》（作者：埃克哈特·托利） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>图书《纳瓦尔宝典》（作者：埃里克·乔根森）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3405">56:45</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>图书《旺自己》 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【与猴哥沟通】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：me@pickten.cn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网站：</span><a href="https://pickten.cn/podcast/" data-url="https://pickten.cn/podcast/"><span>pickten.cn</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：猴哥快溜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【创作素材】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>背景音乐采用《A spiritual christmas》，由mixkit提供</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
