    <title>E3 | 我们的2024 | 猴哥✓Kiddy✓Nancy</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678c8f99fd386523660ca1e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678c8f99fd386523660ca1e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 06:11:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flsf1zmqBLB6wDMKyH_Mw5vko6r9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期播客比较长，欢迎收藏后随时收听，希望每一部分都能给你带来全新的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次播客，由于收声设备的问题，猴哥的声音有一点模糊，给您添麻烦了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>受限于播客平台时长的限制，猴哥使用1.1倍速处理，将正文压缩在了4小时以内。如果你希望听到正常倍速的声音，可以移步“猴哥快溜”收听正常倍速版本。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Kiddy（在这次播客中还被称呼为K老师、刘老师）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nancy（在这次播客中还被称呼为Nan老师、N酱）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Houge y(猴哥，在这次播客中还被称呼为Lu老师、Teemo)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>2024已经结束了，猴哥和Kiddy、Nancy一起聊了聊对2024年的回顾。我们针对很多问题都有很多话想说，以至于我们的播客从上午十点半录到了下午两点半。这些问题你可以在单集简介中看到。我们这次的播客相当于一场马拉松，这是我们对2024年最详实的回顾，希望你能喜欢。你的2024年是怎样的，也可以和我们一起来聊聊。这一期里，请收听我们几个对2024的回顾吧！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrXe8PvfSz0atSrKSjAFt4tTtVzJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>1. 2024，你有你的... <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>a.新的习惯：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a>（Kiddy“一种新的自行车”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a>（Nancy屏蔽力、香薰）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a>（猴哥健身、阅读、学习）</span></p><span></span><p><span>b.新的认知：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a>（Kiddy“时间是不存在的”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a>（Nancy“人生大部分时间都是独行”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3187">53:07</a>（猴哥“和聪明的人探索有趣的事”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>c.新的身份和转变：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3391">56:31</a>（Kiddy“眼里有光睡得香”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3972">1:06:12</a>（Nancy职场转变）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4159">1:09:19</a>（猴哥“六岁猫咪的爸爸”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>d.踩过的大坑：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4365">1:12:45</a>（Kiddy“不要太早规划旅行行程”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4940">1:22:20</a>（Nancy“不要月光”）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6010">1:40:10</a>（猴哥“万事不要期望太高”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>e.做过的猛事：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4588">1:16:28</a>（Kiddy为父亲第一次献血）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5383">1:29:43</a>（Nancy在拉斯维加斯）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6136">1:42:16</a>（猴哥“变成P人”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>f.继承去年的习惯爱好：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6541">1:49:01</a>（猴哥记账）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7677">2:07:57</a>（Kiddy每天捐一分钱）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8833">2:27:13</a>（Nancy健身、坚持学习、旅游）</span></p><span></span><p><span>g.自己的大事记：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9755">2:42:35</a>（Nancy）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10765">2:59:25</a>（Kiddy）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11743">3:15:43</a>（猴哥）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 2025年12月31号那天，回顾2025时，我可能会怀念2025干过的什么事？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12108">3:21:48</a></span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【与猴哥沟通】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：me@pickten.cn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网站：</span><a href="https://pickten.cn/podcast/" data-url="https://pickten.cn/podcast/"><span>pickten.cn</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：猴哥快溜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>【创作素材】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>背景音乐采用《Magic moment》，由mixkit提供。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>单集简介的头图使用AI工具即梦AI处理。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
