    <title>E2 | 我变成了盲人这件事 | 猴哥✓大J</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6751beae17cd5416adca432c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6751beae17cd5416adca432c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大J：猴哥的高中同学。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>猴哥：《猴哥有话说》主播。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听《猴哥友话说》的第二期节目。大J是我的高中同学，在2017年结束后，我们短暂地失去了联系。在上期节目播出后，大J找到我，想跟我聊他毕业之后奇妙的经历。2018年初，大J患病动手术，在此之后视力障碍，变成了一名一级盲人。这一次我们久别重逢，聊了聊大J目前在盲人推拿培训中的所见所闻，探讨了一下自动驾驶，也聊了聊“朋友慢慢离去”的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>盲人生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 大J所在的盲人培训</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 盲人的视力情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 盲人怎么用手机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 大J致盲的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 视力康复治疗的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 盲人培训班趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 大J致盲之后的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span>畅谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 自动驾驶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> “失去”的朋友 讨论1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> “失去”的朋友 讨论2</span></p><span></span><p><span>【与猴哥沟通】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：me@pickten.cn</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网站：</span><a href="https://pickten.cn/podcast/" data-url="https://pickten.cn/podcast/"><span>pickten.cn</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>公众号：猴哥快溜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【创作素材】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>背景音乐采用Ahjay Stelino创作的《Raising Me Higher》，由mixkit提供。</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
